---
// Fibra Engenharia — commercial risk management and people & culture.
// Historical exchange-rate data are loaded from the Banco Central do Brasil (SGS 3698).
---
<section class="risk-people" aria-label="Commercial risk management and people and culture">
  <div class="story-card risk-card">
    <div class="risk-three-columns">
      <div class="risk-narrative">
        <p class="eyebrow">COMMERCIAL RISK MANAGEMENT</p>
        <h3>Protecting a Fixed-Price Contract</h3>
        <p class="intro">Following an August 2014 proposal priced in Brazilian reais, the contract was signed in December at the original fixed prices despite increasing currency volatility. During execution, I coordinated negotiations with US- and Israel-based suppliers, anticipated purchase orders, and leveraged group-company import channels to protect contract margins and maintain delivery commitments.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="risk-chart-wide"><div class="chart-shell">
      <div class="chart-heading"><strong>USD/BRL EXCHANGE RATE</strong><span>Monthly average · Jul 2014 – Jul 2015</span></div>
      <div class="chart-area" data-fibra-fx-chart aria-live="polite"><p class="chart-status">Loading historical exchange-rate data…</p></div>
      <p class="source">Source: <a href="https://dadosabertos.bcb.gov.br/dataset/dolar-americano-usd-todos-os-boletins-diarios" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Banco Central do Brasil</a>, SGS series 3698 (monthly average USD selling rate). Exchange-rate movement illustrates market context, not Fibra’s actual cost exposure.</p>
    </div></div>
      <div class="risk-summary">
        <div class="column-details actions-details"><h4>STRATEGIC ACTIONS</h4><div class="item"><span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="5" y="4" width="14" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M8 9h8M8 13h4M14 15l2 2 3-4"/></svg></span><p><strong>Anticipated purchase orders</strong><small>Advanced purchasing to limit exposure to further increases.</small></p></div><div class="item"><span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M3 12h18M12 3c-5 5-5 13 0 18M12 3c5 5 5 13 0 18M7 8l-2 2 2 2M17 16l2-2-2-2"/></svg></span><p><strong>Imported through group companies</strong><small>Leveraged group-company channels to support procurement.</small></p></div></div>
        <div class="column-details outcomes-details"><h4>BUSINESS OUTCOMES</h4><div class="item"><span class="icon outcome" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2 4 5v6c0 5 3.2 8.6 8 11 4.8-2.4 8-6 8-11V5z"/><path d="m8 12 3 3 5-6"/></svg></span><p><strong>Maintained margins</strong><small>Protected profitability under fixed-price commitments.</small></p></div><div class="item"><span class="icon outcome" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M7 3v4M17 3v4M3 10h18m-13 5 3 3 5-5"/></svg></span><p><strong>Delivered on schedule</strong><small>Maintained delivery continuity and customer commitments.</small></p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="story-card people-card">
    <p class="eyebrow">PEOPLE &amp; CULTURE</p>
    <h3>Developing Teams and Building Lasting Relationships</h3>
    <div class="people-layout"><div class="people-copy"><p>Developed and mentored approximately three project managers, coordinating multidisciplinary teams of more than 50 professionals through delegated leadership. Promoted autonomy, accountability, and knowledge sharing while building trusted professional relationships that extended beyond individual projects.</p><div class="people-pillars"><div><span aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3"/><circle cx="17" cy="9" r="2.5"/><path d="M2 20v-2a6 6 0 0 1 12 0v2M15 14a5 5 0 0 1 7 4v2"/></svg></span><h4>Mentoring and Knowledge Sharing</h4><p>Mentored project managers and shared practical experience to strengthen leadership capabilities.</p></div><div><span aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="3"/><circle cx="17" cy="9" r="2.5"/><path d="M2 20v-2a6 6 0 0 1 12 0v2m2-5 2 2 4-4"/></svg></span><h4>Empowering Teams</h4><p>Delegated responsibilities across project teams, encouraging autonomy and accountability.</p></div><div><span aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="4.2" r="1.7"/><path d="M8.7 11V9.5a3.3 3.3 0 0 1 6.6 0V11"/><circle cx="4.8" cy="15" r="1.7"/><path d="M1.6 22v-1.6a3.2 3.2 0 0 1 6.4 0V22"/><circle cx="19.2" cy="15" r="1.7"/><path d="M16 22v-1.6a3.2 3.2 0 0 1 6.4 0V22"/><path d="M7.5 5.8A9.5 9.5 0 0 0 3 11.4M16.5 5.8a9.5 9.5 0 0 1 4.5 5.6M9.3 22.1a10 10 0 0 0 5.4 0"/></svg></span><h4>Long-Term Relationships</h4><p>Built trust and professional connections that continued beyond individual projects.</p></div></div></div><figure><img src="/images/fibra/fibra-people-illustration.png" alt="Illustrative image of three engineering professionals standing together at an electrical substation" loading="lazy" width="1536" height="1024" /><figcaption>Illustrative image</figcaption></figure></div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .risk-people{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1rem;margin-top:1rem;color:#152c4c}
  .story-card{min-width:0;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #e1eaf4;border-radius:16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff 48%,#f0f7fc);padding:clamp(1.3rem,2.4vw,2rem)}
  .eyebrow{font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.17em;font-weight:800;color:#2474bb;margin:0 0 1rem}
  .eyebrow:after{content:"";display:block;width:43px;height:2px;background:#2396e5;margin-top:.65rem}
  h3{font-size:clamp(1.25rem,2vw,1.75rem);line-height:1.2;color:#102b50;margin:0 0 1rem}
  .risk-three-columns{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,3fr) minmax(0,4fr) minmax(0,3fr);gap:clamp(1rem,2vw,1.8rem);align-items:start}
  .risk-three-columns > *{min-width:0}
  .risk-narrative h3{font-size:clamp(1.2rem,1.75vw,1.65rem)}
  .risk-summary{min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1rem}
  .risk-chart-wide{margin:0;width:100%}
  .intro,.people-copy>p{font-size:.93rem;line-height:1.7;color:#435a72;margin:0}
  
  .chart-shell{min-width:0;border-radius:12px;background:#eef6fc;padding:1rem;margin:0}
  .chart-heading strong{display:block;font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#24527c}
  .chart-heading span{font-size:.76rem;color:#56728f}
  .chart-area{min-height:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
  .chart-area svg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;overflow:visible}
  .chart-status{font-size:.82rem;color:#52677e;text-align:center}
  .source{font-size:.68rem;line-height:1.5;color:#62778c;margin:.3rem 0 0}
  .source a{color:#176eb0;text-decoration:underline}
  .risk-narrative{min-width:0}
  .column-details{padding-top:0}
  .outcomes-details{border-top:1px solid #d9e5f1;padding-top:.85rem}
  .column-details h4{margin-bottom:.8rem}
  h4{font-size:.73rem;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#24527c;margin:0 0 .85rem}
  .item{display:flex;gap:.7rem;align-items:flex-start;margin:.9rem 0}
  .icon{flex:none;width:36px;height:36px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:#e8f4fc;border-radius:10px;color:#1683d0}
  .icon svg,.people-pillars svg{width:23px;height:23px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.8;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}
  .icon.outcome{color:#008f9a;background:#e5f7f5}
  .item p{margin:0}.item strong{display:block;font-size:.83rem;color:#153b68}.item small{display:block;font-size:.75rem;line-height:1.5;color:#52677e;margin-top:.2rem}
  .people-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.15fr) minmax(0,.85fr);gap:clamp(1.2rem,3vw,2.5rem);align-items:stretch}
  .people-copy{min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-start;gap:1.35rem}
  .people-layout figure{position:relative;min-width:0;margin:0;min-height:340px}
  .people-layout img{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;position:absolute;inset:0;object-fit:cover;object-position:center;border-radius:12px}
  .people-layout figcaption{position:absolute;right:.6rem;bottom:.6rem;color:#29475f;background:rgba(255,255,255,.9);border-radius:4px;padding:.2rem .4rem;font-size:.65rem}
  .people-pillars{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.65rem}
  .people-pillars>div{background:#eef6fc;border-radius:12px;text-align:center;padding:1rem .7rem}
  .people-pillars span{display:flex;justify-content:center;color:#1683d0}
  .people-pillars h4{font-size:.81rem;letter-spacing:0;color:#153b68;margin:.7rem 0 .4rem}
  .people-pillars p{font-size:.74rem;line-height:1.5;color:#52677e;margin:0}
  @media(max-width:1180px){.risk-three-columns{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr)}.risk-narrative{grid-column:1}.risk-summary{grid-column:2;grid-row:1}.risk-chart-wide{grid-column:1/-1;grid-row:2}.chart-area{min-height:0}}
  @media(max-width:850px){.people-layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}.people-layout figure{min-height:330px}.people-copy{gap:1.2rem}}
  @media(max-width:650px){.risk-three-columns{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.risk-narrative,.risk-chart-wide,.risk-summary{grid-column:1;grid-row:auto}.risk-chart-wide{grid-row:2}.risk-summary{grid-row:3}.chart-area{min-height:0}}
  @media(max-width:600px){.people-pillars{grid-template-columns:1fr}.people-layout figure{min-height:260px}.story-card{padding:1.2rem}}
</style>
<script>
  const endpoint = 'https://api.bcb.gov.br/dados/serie/bcdata.sgs.3698/dados?formato=json&dataInicial=01/07/2014&dataFinal=31/07/2015';
  const ns = 'http://www.w3.org/2000/svg';
  function node(name: string, attrs: Record<string,string> = {}, value?: string): SVGElement {
    const el = document.createElementNS(ns, name);
    Object.entries(attrs).forEach(([key,val]) => el.setAttribute(key,val));
    if(value !== undefined) el.textContent=value;
    return el;
  }
  async function drawExchangeChart(container: Element) {
    try {
      const response=await fetch(endpoint);
      if(!response.ok) throw new Error('Source unavailable');
      const raw: {data:string;valor:string}[]=await response.json();
      const values=raw.map(d=>({date:d.data,value:Number(d.valor)})).filter(d=>Number.isFinite(d.value)).sort((a,b)=>{const [da,ma,ya]=a.date.split("/").map(Number);const [db,mb,yb]=b.date.split("/").map(Number);return new Date(ya,ma-1,da).getTime()-new Date(yb,mb-1,db).getTime();});
      if(values.length<13) throw new Error('Incomplete series');
      const width=760,height=540,left=50,right=15,top=36,bottom=42;
      const min=2.0;
      const max=4.0;
      const x=(i:number)=>left+i*(width-left-right)/(values.length-1);
      const y=(v:number)=>top+(max-v)*(height-top-bottom)/(max-min);
      const svg=node('svg',{viewBox:`0 0 ${width} ${height}`,role:'img','aria-label':'Monthly average USD to Brazilian real exchange rate, July 2014 to July 2015, sourced from Banco Central do Brasil'});
      for(let tick=min;tick<=max;tick+=.5){const yy=y(tick);svg.append(node('line',{x1:String(left),x2:String(width-right),y1:String(yy),y2:String(yy),stroke:'#d4e5f2'}));svg.append(node('text',{x:'5',y:String(yy+4),fill:'#607992','font-size':'14'},tick.toFixed(1)));}
      // Proposal and signature dates are plotted proportionally between monthly observations.
      // The shaded band marks the negotiation period, not a measured FX exposure.
      const startTime=Date.UTC(2014,6,1), endTime=Date.UTC(2015,6,1);
      const dateX=(year:number,month:number,day:number)=>left+(Date.UTC(year,month-1,day)-startTime)/(endTime-startTime)*(width-left-right);
      const proposalX=dateX(2014,8,14), signatureX=dateX(2014,12,19);
      // Weeks 8–12 following contract signature: approximately 9 Feb–15 Mar 2015.
      // This is the planned equipment delivery window, not actual delivery dates.
      const deliveryStartX=dateX(2015,2,9), deliveryEndX=dateX(2015,3,15);
      svg.append(node('rect',{x:String(proposalX),y:String(top),width:String(signatureX-proposalX),height:String(height-top-bottom),fill:'#9bd5ec','fill-opacity':'0.18'}));
      svg.append(node('rect',{x:String(deliveryStartX),y:String(top),width:String(deliveryEndX-deliveryStartX),height:String(height-top-bottom),fill:'#69bba8','fill-opacity':'0.20'}));
      const path=values.map((d,i)=>`${i?'L':'M'}${x(i).toFixed(1)},${y(d.value).toFixed(1)}`).join(' ');
      svg.append(node('path',{d:path,fill:'none',stroke:'#1679c8','stroke-width':'3.2','stroke-linejoin':'round','stroke-linecap':'round'}));
      // Interpolate milestone markers on the monthly series without changing source data.
      const milestoneY=(markerX:number)=>{
        const index=Math.max(0,Math.min(values.length-2,(markerX-left)/(width-left-right)*(values.length-1)));
        const i=Math.floor(index), fraction=index-i;
        return y(values[i].value+(values[i+1].value-values[i].value)*fraction);
      };
      [
        {x:proposalX,color:'#1976C9',label:'Proposal',anchor:'end',dx:-10},
        {x:signatureX,color:'#0096A3',label:'Signed',anchor:'end',dx:-10}
      ].forEach(m=>{
        const markerY=milestoneY(m.x);
        svg.append(node('line',{x1:String(m.x),x2:String(m.x),y1:String(top),y2:String(height-bottom),stroke:m.color,'stroke-width':'1.4','stroke-dasharray':'4 4'}));
        svg.append(node('circle',{cx:String(m.x),cy:String(markerY),r:'10',fill:m.color}));
        svg.append(node('text',{x:String(m.x+m.dx),y:String(markerY-14),'text-anchor':m.anchor,fill:m.color,'font-size':'20','font-weight':'700'},m.label));
      });
      // Keep the planned window label centered at the top of the green band.
      const deliveryMid=(deliveryStartX+deliveryEndX)/2;
      const deliveryLabel=node('text',{x:String(deliveryMid),y:String(top+21),'text-anchor':'middle',fill:'#247f70','font-size':'18','font-weight':'700'});
      deliveryLabel.append(node('tspan',{x:String(deliveryMid),dy:'0'},'Planned'));
      deliveryLabel.append(node('tspan',{x:String(deliveryMid),dy:'21'},'delivery'));
      svg.append(deliveryLabel);
      [0,3,6,9,12].forEach(i=>{if(i>=values.length)return;const month=values[i].date.split('/');const label=`${['Jan','Feb','Mar','Apr','May','Jun','Jul','Aug','Sep','Oct','Nov','Dec'][Number(month[1])-1]} ${month[2]}`;svg.append(node('text',{x:String(x(i)),y:String(height-7),'text-anchor':i===0?'start':i===values.length-1?'end':'middle',fill:'#607992','font-size':'14'},label));});
      container.replaceChildren(svg);
    } catch {
      container.innerHTML='<p class="chart-status">Historical chart temporarily unavailable. Please consult the linked Banco Central source.</p>';
    }
  }
  document.querySelectorAll('[data-fibra-fx-chart]').forEach(drawExchangeChart);
</script>
